            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n项目ID,用于明确项目归属,配置后可通过该ID查询项目下资产,可以通过调用API获取,也可以从控制台获取。[获取项目ID](secmaster_03_0014.xml)\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 36,
            "minLength": 32
          },
          {
            "name": "workspace_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n工作空间id。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 36,
            "minLength": 32
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Language",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n语言,参考值:zh-cn、en-us\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\nzh-cn:中文环境\nen-us:英文环境\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 6,
            "minLength": 2
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n用户Token,通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。[获取用户Token](secmaster_03_0010.xml)\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 2097152,
            "minLength": 0,
            "x-example": "MIIDkgYJKoZIhvcNAQcCoIIDgzCCXXXXX..."
          },
          {
            "name": "content-type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n内容类型\n- application/json;charset=UTF-8    普通API请求的类型\n\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n- application/json;charset=UTF-8\n\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "application/json;charset=UTF-8",
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "资产类型",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "provider",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "资产提供商",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "uploadFile",
            "in": "formData",
            "description": "导入资产文件",
            "required": true,
            "type": "file"
          }
        ],
